    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Time Traveling Toxicologist is an educational game for medical professionals who want to learn about managing poisoned patients. The game uses a fictional narrative in which the player investigates the scene of a poisoning, and then transmits medical recommendations back in time to the patient's treating physician. The goal is to uncover clues and advance the medical care of the patient and save their life!</p>",
